<section class="scene" data-scene="01"><div class="scene-head"><div><h2>01 · 资料采集</h2><p>收集并登记原始材料的名称、来源、事实截止时间与用途边界，确定哪些内容可以进入知识库。</p></div><span class="badge">PENDING ARCHIVE</span></div><div class="grid-4" id="collection-board"></div><div class="preview" id="collection-preview"></div><div class="result">本幕结果：四份待归档材料。此时还没有 Wiki、P 页面或问答系统。</div></section>
<section class="scene" data-scene="02" hidden><div class="scene-head"><div><h2>02 · Raw 原件</h2><p>将核验后的材料完整归档为只读 Raw 文档，保留原文、元数据与来源路径，作为后续编译的事实底稿。</p></div><span class="badge green">READ ONLY</span></div><div class="tree-layout"><aside class="tree"><div class="tree-title">content/raw/</div><div id="raw-files"></div></aside><article class="doc" id="raw-doc"></article></div><div class="result">本幕结果：R1–R4 四篇冻结 Raw。它们是原件，不是摘要，也不是 Wiki 页面。</div></section>
<section class="scene" data-scene="03" data-query-object="query-replay" hidden><div class="scene-head"><div><h2>03 · 基线问答</h2><p>在尚未生成 Wiki 时，仅使用 Raw 回答固定问题，记录真实检索路径、可回答内容与证据缺口。</p></div><span class="badge red">DSH CLI rc.7</span></div><div class="replay"><article class="question-card" id="baseline-question"></article><section class="terminal" id="baseline-terminal"></section></div></section>
<section class="scene" data-scene="04" hidden><div class="scene-head"><div><h2>04 · 规则与知识地图</h2><p>定义页面类型、编译规则与来源映射，把四篇 Raw 规划成 P1–P8 八个待生成的知识对象。</p></div><span class="badge red">PLANNING / NOT GENERATED</span></div><div class="map-layout"><article class="rule-box" id="rule-box"></article><section><div class="types"><div class="type">concept · 概念</div><div class="type">system · 系统</div><div class="type">playbook · 操作</div><div class="type">policy · 策略</div></div><div class="map" id="page-map"></div></section></div><div class="result">本幕结果：R1–R4 到 P1–P8 的多对多规划图。页面尚未生成。</div></section>
<section class="scene" data-scene="05" hidden><div class="scene-head"><div><h2>05 · 首个知识页</h2><p>先用 R1 编写一篇可追溯的教学草稿，检查引用、内容边界与页面结构是否符合编译规则。</p></div><span class="badge red">TEACHING DRAFT / EXCLUDED FROM MANIFEST</span></div><div class="draft-flow"><section class="evidence-list" id="single-evidence"></section><div class="arrow">→</div><article class="card" id="single-draft"></article></div></section>
<section class="scene" data-scene="06" hidden><div class="scene-head"><div><h2>06 · 跨来源编译</h2><p>围绕同一主题联合读取 R1–R4，去重并重组跨文档知识，生成带来源引用和内部链接的正式 P2 页面。</p></div><span class="badge green">FORMAL PAGE · P2</span></div><div class="contrib" id="contributions"></div><article class="p2"><div class="tabs" id="p2-tabs"></div><div class="tab-panel" id="p2-panel"></div></article><div class="legend"><span class="citation">[R1] 来源引用：回答结论从哪里来</span><span class="internal">P3 内部链接：回答下一步读什么</span></div></section>
