<section class="scene" data-scene="08" data-query-object="query-replay" hidden><div class="scene-head"><div><h2>08 · Wiki 问答</h2><p>让 DSH 定位相关页面、沿内部链接扩展并回查 Raw，演示事实问答、跨页问答与语料外拒答。</p></div><span class="badge red">官方 DSH CLI rc.7 · STATIC REPLAY</span></div><div class="qa-tabs" id="qa-tabs"></div><div class="grid-2"><article class="question-card" id="qa-summary"></article><section class="terminal" id="qa-terminal"></section></div></section>
