credentials.md\n11: links:\n12:   - P2\n13:   - P3\n14:   - P5\n15:   - P7\n16:   - P8\n17: updated: 2026-08-19T16:00:00+08:00\n18: ---\n19: \n20: # Plugin、MCP 与工具成功信号\n21: \n22: ## 摘要\n23: \n24: Plugin 是 Harness 生命周期与装配单元；MCP client 把外部 Server 的 tools 桥接进工具表。发现、安装、挂载、调用和外部结果不能合并为一个信号。\n25: \n26: ## 结论\n27: \n28: - 当前 DSH MCP 合同桥接 tools，不应把 Server 的 resources/prompts 写成已被 Harness 消费。\n29: - 工具列表存在不等于 provider seam 可用，更不等于目标外部状态已经改变。\n30: - 外部工具还受 Session 权限、网络、凭证解析和第三方服务状态约束。\n31: \n32: ## 来源证据\n33: \n34: - R3：rc.6 Web Plugin 开启后 Search 成功、Fetch 因 provider seam 失败，直接区分装配与动作成功。\n35: - R3：MCP 只有 rc.11 官方源码合同，本实验没有本机调用正例。\n36: - R2、R4：Preset 组合工具但 Host/凭证仍控制真实调用边界。\n37: \n38: ## 相关页面\n39: \n40: - [P2](agent-preset-composition.md)\n41: - [P3](skill-method-layer.md)\n42: - [P5](dsh-capability-layers.md)\n43: - [P7](permissions-and-credentials.md)\n44: - [P8](evidence-driven-delivery.md)\n\n(End of file - total 44 lines)\n<\/content>"},{"sequence":16,"type":"tool/result","name":"","text":"<path><WORKSPACE>/content/wiki/pages/agent-preset-composition.md<\/path>\n<type>file<\/type>\n<content>\n1: ---\n2: id: P2\n3: title: Agent Preset 的组合与生效\n4: type: system\n5: topic: 主 Agent 装配\n6: slug: agent-preset-composition\n7: sources:\n8:   - ../../raw/R1-dsh-workspace-session.md\n9:   - ../../raw/R2-dsh-agent-preset.md\n10:   - ../../raw/R3-dsh-skills-plugins-mcp.md\n11:   - ../../raw/R4-dsh-team-security-credentials.md\n12: links:\n13:   - P1\n14:   - P3\n15:   - P4\n16:   - P5\n17:   - P6\n18: updated: 2026-08-19T16:00:00+08:00\n19: ---\n20: \n21: # Agent Preset 的组合与生效\n22: \n23: ## 摘要\n24: \n25: Preset 把角色、规则、Skills、Plugin/MCP 与标准工具组合成主 Agent 工作方式，并在用它创建的新 Session 中生效；它不是模型选项，也不是 Subagent。\n26: \n27: ## 结论\n28: \n29: - Preset 原件、roster 发现、新 Session 装配和业务结果是四个不同完成信号。\n30: - Host 继续持有 sandbox、approval、持久化和模型路由，Preset 不能越过 Host 边界。\n31: - 修改 Preset 后应创建新 Session 验证，不能用旧 Session 或文件存在代替运行。\n32: \n33: ## 来源证据\n34: \n35: - R2：rc.6 自定义 Preset 经历错误包名、缺必填配置、修复后新 Session 生效的恢复链。\n36: - R3：Skill 发现/加载和 Plugin 安装/工具成功有各自生命周期，Preset 只负责组合候选能力。\n37: - R1、R4：Session 绑定 cwd/权限；Subagent 是运行时委派，不是 Preset 文件。\n38: \n39: ## 相关页面\n40: \n41: - [P1](workspace-session-context.md)\n42: - [P3](skill-method-layer.md)\n43: - [P4](plugin-mcp-tools.md)\n44: - [P5](dsh-capability-layers.md)\n45: - [P6](team-delegation-workflow.md)\n\n(End of file - total 45 lines)\n<\/content>"},{"sequence":17,"type":"tool/result","name":"","text":"<path><WORKSPACE>/content/wiki/pages/team-delegation-workflow.md<\/path>\n<type>file<\/type>\n<content>\n1: ---\n2: id: P6\n3: title: 父子 Agent 委派与回收流程\n4: type: playbook\n5: topic: 团队工作流\n6: slug: team-delegation-workflow\n7: sources:\n8:   - ../../raw/R2-dsh-agent-preset.md\n9:   - ../../raw/R4-dsh-team-security-credentials.md\n10: links:\n11:   - P2\n12:   - P5\n13:   - P8\n14: updated: 2026-08-19T16:00:00+08:00\n15: ---\n16: \n17: # 父子 Agent 委派与回收流程\n18: \n19: ## 摘要\n20: \n21: 父 Agent 定义边界与写域，子 Session 完成局部任务，父级核验真实产物并汇总。子 Agent 自报完成不是最终交付。\n22: \n23: ## 结论\n24: \n25: - 委派前写清输入、唯一写域和验收问题；共享目录中的并行任务必须互斥。\n26: - 子结果返回后检查非空原件与直接结果，再由父级综合。\n27: - 只精确清理本轮 Session/进程，不复用或关闭老师现有会话。\n28: \n29: ## 来源证据\n30: \n31: - R4：rc.6 三个 origin=subagent 子 Session 返回后，父 Session 恢复并汇总。\n32: - R2：subagent 属于运行时行为，不是切换或复制 Preset。\n33: \n34: ## 相关页面\n35: \n36: - [P2](agent-preset-composition.md)\n37: - [P5](dsh-capability-layers.md)\n38: - [P8](evidence-driven-delivery.md)\n\n(End of file - total 38 lines)\n<\/content>"},{"sequence":18,"type":"tool/call","name":"read","text":"read · {\"file_path\": \"content/wiki/pages/dsh-capability-layers.md\"}"},{"sequence":19,"type":"tool/call","name":"read","text":"read · {\"file_path\": \"content/wiki/pages/evidence-driven-delivery.md\"}"},{"sequence":20,"type":"tool/call","name":"read","text":"read · {\"file_path\": \"content/wiki/pages/permissions-and-credentials.md\"}"},{"sequence":21,"type":"tool/call","name":"read","text":"read · {\"file_path\": \"content/wiki/pages/workspace-session-context.md\"}"},{"sequence":22,"type":"tool/result","name":"","text":"<path><WORKSPACE>/content/wiki/pages/dsh-capability-layers.md<\/path>\n<type>file<\/type>\n<content>\n1: ---\n2: id: P5\n3: title: DSH 能力层：方法、工具、装配与委派\n4: type: concept\n5: topic: 能力分层\n6: slug: dsh-capability-layers\n7: sources:\n8:   - ../../raw/R2-dsh-agent-preset.md\n9:   - ../../raw/R3-dsh-skills-plugins-mcp.md\n10:   - ../../raw/R4-dsh-team-security-credentials.md\n11: links:\n12:   - P2\n13:   - P3\n14:   - P4\n15:   - P6\n16:   - P7\n17: updated: 2026-08-19T16:00:00+08:00\n18: ---\n19: \n20: # DSH 能力层：方法、工具、装配与委派\n21: \n22: ## 摘要\n23: \n24: Skill 提供方法，Plugin/MCP 提供工具或服务连接，Preset 组合主 Agent 工作方式，Subagent/Workflow 在运行时执行委派。分层的目的，是为每个对象选择正确完成信号。\n25: \n26: ## 结论\n27: \n28: - 四类对象可以协作，但文件格式、生命周期和验证入口不同。\n29: - 能力存在于源码或配置中，只能说明候选；必须继续验证 Session 可见性、调用和直接结果。\n30: - 底层已有 subagent/workflow 不等于完整 Desktop 多 Agent 管理产品面已交付。\n31: \n32: ## 来源证据\n33: \n34: - R2：Preset 是主 Agent composition，Subagent 是运行时委派。\n35: - R3：Skill 与 Plugin/MCP 分别承担方法和可执行能力。\n36: - R4：父子 Session 与权限/凭证边界要求最终由父级核验。\n37: \n38: ## 相关页面\n39: \n40: - [P2](agent-preset-composition.md)\n41: - [P3](skill-method-layer.md)\n42: - [P4](plugin-mcp-tools.md)\n43: - [P6](team-delegation-workflow.md)\n44: - [P7](permissions-and-credentials.md)\n\n(End of file - total 44 lines)\n<\/content>"},{"sequence":23,"type":"tool/result","name":"","text":"<path><WORKSPACE>/content/wiki/pages/evidence-driven-delivery.md<\/path>\n<type>file<\/type>\n<content>\n1: ---\n2: id: P8\n3: title: 用证据链判断 Agent 项目是否完成\n4: type: playbook\n5: topic: 可验证交付\n6: slug: evidence-driven-delivery\n7: sources:\n8:   - ../../raw/R1-dsh-workspace-session.md\n9:   - ../../raw/R2-dsh-agent-preset.md\n10:   - ../../raw/R3-dsh-skills-plugins-mcp.md\n11:   - ../../raw/R4-dsh-team-security-credentials.md\n12: links:\n13:   - P4\n14:   - P6\n15:   - P7\n16: updated: 2026-08-19T16:00:00+08:00\n17: ---\n18: \n19: # 用证据链判断 Agent 项目是否完成\n20: \n21: ## 摘要\n22: \n23: 可信交付把原件、装配、可见工具事件、直接结果与版本边界连起来；退出码、文件存在或 Agent 自报都不能单独承重。\n24: \n25: ## 结论\n26: \n27: - 先打开配置/源码/输入原件，再看运行装配和工具事件，最后以目标对象或功能问题验收。\n28: - 失败证据只能证明失败；修复后必须有同口径重跑与新成功结果。\n29: - 旧版本真实运行和当前官方声明要分开标注，不相互冒充。\n30: \n31: ## 来源证据\n32: \n33: - R1：Workspace 文件哈希和 Session 状态给出直接对象信号。\n34: - R2：Preset 错误包名→缺配置→新 Session 成功展示恢复链。\n35: - R3：Search/Fetch 对照揭示工具存在不等于目标动作成功。\n36: - R4：子 Agent 返回与父级最终验收、凭证引用与真实消费均需分层。\n37: \n38: ## 相关页面\n39: \n40: - [P4](plugin-mcp-tools.md)\n41: - [P6](team-delegation-workflow.md)\n42: - [P7](permissions-and-credentials.md)\n\n(End of file - total 42 lines)\n<\/content>"},{"sequence":24,"type":"tool/result","name":"","text":"<path><WORKSPACE>/content/wiki/pages/permissions-and-credentials.md<\/path>\n<type>file<\/type>\n<content>\n1: ---\n2: id: P7\n3: title: Session 权限与凭证消费政策\n4: type: policy\n5: topic: 安全边界\n6: slug: permissions-and-credentials\n7: sources:\n8:   - ../../raw/R1-dsh-workspace-session.md\n9:   - ../../raw/R3-dsh-skills-plugins-mcp.md\n10:   - ../../raw/R4-dsh-team-security-credentials.md\n11: links:\n12:   - P1\n13:   - P4\n14:   - P5\n15:   - P8\n16: updated: 2026-08-19T16:00:00+08:00\n17: ---\n18: \n19: # Session 权限与凭证消费政策\n20: \n21: ## 摘要\n22: \n23: Session 权限、Host sandbox、工具策略与 OS 权限共同形成有效边界；凭证以引用进入配置，由真实消费者按优先级解析，明文不进入提示词、参数、日志或截图。\n24: \n25: ## 结论\n26: \n27: - 只读、工作区写入、完全访问是 Session 操作档位，不是企业 RBAC 或完整审计。\n28: - 凭证优先级为进程环境、受管凭证文件、项目 .env、用户 .env；配置只保存引用。\n29: - 0600 保护其他 OS 用户，不能保证同 UID 工具进程绝对无法读取；因此仍要缩小可见路径与消费面。\n30: \n31: ## 来源证据\n32: \n33: - R4：当前官方凭证 provider 的引用、describe、优先级、0600 与同 UID caveat。\n34: - R1：Workspace registry 不是文件秘密边界。\n35: - R3：Plugin/MCP 的外部动作仍要单独证明凭证消费与目标结果。\n36: \n37: ## 相关页面\n38: \n39: - [P1](workspace-session-context.md)\n40: - [P4](plugin-mcp-tools.md)\n41: - [P5](dsh-capability-layers.md)\n42: - [P8](evidence-driven-delivery.md)\n\n(End of file - total 42 lines)\n<\/content>"},{"sequence":25,"type":"tool/result","name":"","text":"<path><WORKSPACE>/content/wiki/pages/workspace-session-context.md<\/path>\n<type>file<\/type>\n<content>\n1: ---\n2: id: P1\n3: title: Workspace、Session 与上下文边界\n4: type: concept\n5: topic: DSH 运行上下文\n6: slug: workspace-session-context\n7: sources:\n8:   - ../../raw/R1-dsh-workspace-session.md\n9:   - ../../raw/R2-dsh-agent-preset.md\n10:   - ../../raw/R4-dsh-team-security-credentials.md\n11: links:\n12:   - P2\n13:   - P7\n14: updated: 2026-08-19T16:00:00+08:00\n15: ---\n16: \n17: # Workspace、Session 与上下文边界\n18: \n19: ## 摘要\n20: \n21: Workspace 是 Host 对真实目录的持久登记，Session 是带 cwd、装配、权限与事件历史的运行对象。两者相关但不等同，登记目录也不等于模型已经读取目录。\n22: \n23: ## 结论\n24: \n25: - 登记 Workspace 不会自动生成项目、Skill、Preset 或 Wiki；删除登记也不等于删除磁盘目录或持久 Session。\n26: - Session 日志是权威运行历史，projection cache 是可重建读取加速，不应称为长期 Memory。\n27: - 可见文件范围由 cwd、工具、Session 权限与 OS 权限共同决定，Workspace registry 本身不是秘密边界。\n28: \n29: ## 来源证据\n30: \n31: - R1：rc.6 登记前后 13 个文件与关键 SHA-256 未变；当前官方合同说明 create 规范化真实目录，delete 不删用户文件。\n32: - R2：Preset 在新 Session 生效，说明 Session composition 与 Workspace registry 不是一个生命周期。\n33: - R4：Session 权限、Host sandbox 和 OS 权限共同限定操作面。\n34: \n35: ## 相关页面\n36: \n37: - [P2](agent-preset-composition.md)\n38: - [P7](permissions-and-credentials.md)\n\n(End of file - total 38 lines)\n<\/content>"},{"sequence":26,"type":"tool/call","name":"read","text":"read · {\"file_path\": \"content/wiki/manifest.json\"}"},{"sequence":27,"type":"tool/call","name":"read","text":"read · {\"file_path\": \"content/wiki/log.md\"}"},{"sequence":28,"type":"tool/call","name":"read","text":"read · {\"file_path\": \"rules/wiki-contract.md\"}"},{"sequence":29,"type":"tool/result","name":"","text":"<path><WORKSPACE>/content/wiki/manifest.json<\/path>\n<type>file<\/type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"schema_version\": 1,\n3:   \"state\": \"initial\",\n4:   \"generated_at\": \"2026-08-19T16:00:00+08:00\",\n5:   \"statistics\": {\n6:     \"page_count\": 8,\n7:     \"source_count\": 4,\n8:     \"type_count\": 4,\n9:     \"link_count\": 30\n10:   },\n11:   \"pages\": [\n12:     {\n13:       \"id\": \"P1\",\n14:       \"slug\": \"workspace-session-context\",\n15:       \"title\": \"Workspace